{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wU9jTwc3ug1793285770.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>歐洲央行宣布，維持利率不變。另外，行長拉加德將提早在明年2月卸任。</p><p></p><p>歐洲央行議息會議後宣布，基準存款利率保持在2.5厘，主要再融資利率和邊際貸款利率，分別為2.65厘和2.9厘。符合市場預期。</p><p></p><p>歐洲央行行長拉加德表示，數據反映歐元區上季經濟持續擴張，出口回暖，基本通脹大致穩定。能源價格急漲，正在衝擊消費者信心。</p><p></p><p>另外，歐洲央行確認，拉加德將在明年2月卸任行長職務較原定任期提早近九個月。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:54.136758+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.761995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:31.058344+00:00","content_hash":"c918d83f6ee6d321ba5d0b103ff58b70fe751bb888b7430ec19f5b48ca6480f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:54.136758+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}